  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together apricot jam, soy sauce, crushed peanuts, brown sugar, and rice vinegar.",
    "Add chickpeas to the bowl and toss to coat.",
    "Thread chickpea mixture onto bamboo skewers.",
    "Brush kissed sesame oil on the skewers.",
    "Grill skewers for 10-12 minutes, turning occasionally.",
